  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 0.78,
    "y": 2.21,
    "text": "1  Build each edge message",
    "size": 15,
    "color": "#007F83",
    "bold": true
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 0.78,
    "y": 2.71,
    "text": "m(j\u2192i) = M\u2096([z\u2c7c, z\u1d62, a\u2c7c\u1d62])\nUse source and destination features.\nEdge attributes a are optional.",
