  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 10.16,
    "y": 2.21,
    "text": "3  Update the destination",
    "size": 15,
    "color": "#007F83",
    "bold": true
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 10.16,
    "y": 2.71,
    "text": "z\u1d62 \u2190 z\u1d62 + U\u2096([z\u1d62, m\u0304\u1d62])\nResidual update retains local features.\nNo incoming edges:\nnode stays unchanged.",
    "size": 13,
    "color": "#243C4B",
    "bold": false
