  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 13.78,
    "y": 5.08,
    "text": "How we test its value",
    "size": 15,
    "color": "#123147",
    "bold": true
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 13.78,
    "y": 5.58,
    "text": "Same U-Net and connected context batches:\n\u2022 U-Net without graph messages\n\u2022 Local capacity control with self edges\n\u2022 Graph with actual adjacency edges\nMatch data, losses and evaluation origins.",
